            "review_title": "Review at Breadzone",
            "review_text": "quynph13\n3 contributions\n0\nDa Nang street food's delicacy: Banh My\nMar 2016 • Friends\nDuring my 3-day trip in Danang, I found out that there are many tourist restaurants, which serves too many Western cuisines. I think that what is the point of being in Danang without trying any Danang-ish foods. \nIf you are travelling in Danang city and feel like buying some takeaway Danang food to enjoy on the way, Breadzone is the place. Breadzone came up to me as a superb fastfood local restaurant, which has Banh Mi (Vietnamese sandwich) as their specialty. Breadzone's Banh Mi is such a mouthwatering, unforgettable Danang streetfood's delicacy. Really meaty from the inside, together with the fresh herbs and excellent meat sauce, it is an unforgettable, must-try sandwich once you are here.\nThe price of all items in the menu is exceptionally satisfying, including many really special beverages. Service is really fast and professional. \nThis is the place where I have to remind myself to visit everytime go back to Danang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 26, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
