            "review_title": "Review at Breadzone",
            "review_text": "Jeff B\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam70 contributions\n0\nBanh Mi and flavoured tea\nMar 2016 • Solo\nHad a quick stop in for a banh mi thit ga or chicken sandwich VN style. It was alright. Nothing bad. Just not a lot of meat in it.\n\nThe peach tea was flavoured with monin syrup. It was fine too.\n\nOverall rating was ok. Stop in if you are there but no need to go out of your way to find it.\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2016",
